{
  "date": "2026-08-31",
  "period_start": "2026-08-01",
  "period_end": "2026-08-31",
  "title": "More ways to make media",
  "summary": "August widened what people can generate and publish, while making the growing catalog easier to navigate and its costs easier to understand.\n\nNew image and video choices included Qwen Image 3, Seedance 2.5, Wan 3.0, Gemini Omni and FLUX.2. Speech expanded too, with new voices and batch and live transcription. Resolution, duration and reference-media controls became more explicit.\n\nMy Models gained publishing paths for transcription, embeddings and video, plus clearer capability metadata, testing and monitoring. Community providers can now describe more of what their endpoints actually do.\n\nEditable prompt agents joined My Models, then gained visible tool calls, delegation and a hosted MCP tool directory. Hosted tools added generation, transcription, web search and FFmpeg media processing; Floret gained more audio and video work.\n\nEnter added faster model browsing, capability and access filters, clearer prices and limits, and links from catalog rows into Play. The community app directory gained searchable listings and screenshots across all active apps.",
  "pr_count": 418,
